# Git Ignore Configuration File
# 
# This file instructs Git which local files and directories to exclude from version control.
# Fine-tuning and Iteration: Add custom build artifacts, local database files, 
# or IDE-specific settings (like .vscode/) here if expanding your project environment.

# Virtual Environments (Exclude local interpreter dependencies)
.venv/
env/
venv/

# PyTorch Model Weights (Exclude binary weight files to keep repository lightweight)
models/*.pth

# Generated Datasets (Exclude mass-generated training imagery regenerated via scripts)
data/synthetic_generated/

# Gradio Logs and Local Feedback (Exclude runtime UI logs and flagged feedback CSVs)
.gradio/
*.csv

# Python Cache (Exclude compiled bytecode and cache folders)
__pycache__/
*.pyc